          "content": "fileFormatVersion: 2\nguid: 68cf63f843114ee5a06574618cbc0583\nMonoImporter:\n  externalObjects: {}\n  serializedVersion: 2\n  defaultReferences: []\n  executionOrder: 0\n  icon: {instanceID: 0}\n  userData: \n  assetBundleName: \n  assetBundleVariant: \n"
